Subject: [PATCH 1/6]  vmm: add DST virtual clock module

Patch 0001: dst-virtual-clock
- Add dst/ module with VirtualClock (lock-free monotonic counter)
- VirtualClock provides advance(), freeze/unfreeze, HLT counter
- Add dst_clock and dst_seed fields to Vmm struct
- Virtual epoch: 2024-01-01T00:00:00Z
